a previously-deleted listing ('QA Vintage Radio') returns 0 results when searched by name, i.e. deleted listings are likewise absent from browse/search.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Registered QA Tester / qa.tester.revive@example.com / Seattle, WA; after submit redirected to home with signed-in header showing My Profile, My Listings, Log out, Sell, Cart links.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Combined Furniture category + New condition + Upcycled-only + price min $250 filters correctly narrowed 10->1 item (only the $320 item, correctly excluding the $175 Furniture/New/Upcycled item below the price floor). Distance slider reduced from 26mi to 13mi correctly excluded the San Francisco item (10->9). Sort 'Price: Low to High' produced strictly ascending order ($35...$320); Sort 'Distance' produced a different valid ordering grouping nearer sellers first (Brooklyn/Austin before Portland/San Francisco, consistent with the distance filter's exclusion). 'Clear all filters' after each combination restored the full unfiltered 10-item set.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Searching 'PORTLAND' (uppercase) matched 3 listings by location 'Portland, OR' (case-insensitive location match). Searching 'velvet' matched 1 listing (Mid-Century Modern Armchair) via a word only present in its description. Clearing the search box restored the count to 10 items (the full unsearched set).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Signed in as QA Retest User, added Emma's 'Mid-Century Modern Armchair' ($285, Brooklyn NY) to cart from its detail page. Cart page shows the item once with photo, title, location 'Brooklyn, NY', price $285, and Total $285.00 - matches exactly.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typed non-empty message in Message Seller dialog for prod-1 (owned by Emma Green, not current user); Send Message button became enabled after text entry; clicking Send closed dialog and displayed toast \\\"Message sent to seller!\\\" confirming submission.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-21\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Category selection from Categories page does not filter browse results\", \"actual\": \"On /categories, Furniture showed '3 items'. Clicking it navigated to /?category=furniture, but the Browse page displayed all 10 listings (unfiltered) with count 'browse.count 10 items available', and the Furniture checkbox in the filter sidebar was NOT checked. The category selection was not applied to the browse results or count.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Missing seller-side feature: no way to view buyer messages or purchase requests\", \"actual\": \"As buyer (Marcus), sent a Message Seller text and a cart 'Send Purchase Request' for Emma's listing prod-1, both showing success toasts ('Message sent to seller!' and 'Purchase requests sent to sellers!'). Logged in as seller Emma Green afterward and searched the entire app for any way to view the received request/message: header has no notifications/requests icon or badge, 'My Profile' menu link routes to a 404 page (feature missing/broken), My Listings page shows no message/request count or link per listing, and viewing own listing (prod-1) as owner only shows a 'Manage Your Listings' button with no buyer inquiry/request section. There is no UI surface anywhere for the seller to view the requested item or buyer's message, so the checklist requirement cannot be fulfilled.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Login with unregistered email nonexistent.user.qa@example.com showed toast 'Invalid credentials. Try: emma@example.com', stayed on /login, header still shows Log in/Sign up (no session).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Registered qa.retest.revive@example.com as 'QA Retest User'. Attempting to re-register with the case-only variation 'QA.Retest.Revive@Example.com' (different name/password/location) was rejected with toast 'An account with this email already exists', stayed on /register with form retained. Logging back in with the original account's credentials confirmed the original account (name 'QA Retest User', same email) was untouched/not replaced. (Earlier FAIL verdict was due to a test artifact: an intervening full-page reload had wiped the in-memory account before the duplicate attempt, which is now corrected using in-app navigation only.)\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Any password authenticates a registered account, not just the correct one\", \"actual\": \"Registered qa.retest.revive@example.com with password 'correctpass' (in-app navigation only, no reload). After logging out and logging back in with the same email but wrong password 'wrongpass123', login succeeded and the header/user-menu showed 'QA Retest User' / qa.retest.revive@example.com signed in - i.e. an incorrect password was accepted rather than rejected.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Viewing another seller's listing (prod-1, owned by Emma Green) while signed in as QA Retest User shows buyer controls 'Add to Cart' and 'Message Seller' but no 'Manage Your Listings' or Mark Sold/Delete controls. Conversely, viewing own listings (e.g. QA Vintage Radio, QA FT4 Sold Test Lamp) only exposed 'Manage Your Listings' with no Add to Cart/Message Seller buttons. Seller-management actions are correctly scoped to the owning seller only.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No missing-field identification shown to seller\", \"actual\": \"Clicking 'Create Listing' with no photo, title, description, price, category, or condition filled in did not create a listing (correct), but also produced no visible error message, toast, inline validation, or aria-invalid marker identifying which required fields were missing — checked DOM for aria-invalid/.error/[role=alert] elements and found none. The seller is given no feedback about why the submission did not proceed.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Filled a listing form with photo, title, description, category=Furniture, condition=Good, location=Brooklyn NY, and price=-10, then submitted. Form remained on /create-listing (no navigation to new listing), and My Listings for the account still shows only the original 2 items (prod-1, prod-5) — no new listing with the negative price was created.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Inconsistent/missing auth gating - protected routes render blank page instead of sign-in prompt or redirect\", \"actual\": \"Behavior is inconsistent across protected actions while signed out: (1) Clicking 'Add to Cart' on a product detail page correctly redirects to /login and shows toast 'Please log in to add items to your cart' - PASS behavior. (2) Clicking 'Message Seller' opens the dialog but only disables the send button with label 'Log in to message' - no actual link/redirect to sign in, a UX dead-end. (3) Directly navigating to protected routes /create-listing, /cart, and /my-listings while signed out renders a completely blank page (only notification regions, no content, no redirect, no sign-in prompt) - these routes are not gated at all at the page level, leaving the user with no guidance or way to proceed. This fails the requirement that unauthenticated attempts be consistently blocked with a clear sign-in prompt or redirect.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Re-attempting registration with a case-only variant of an existing email produced an immediate toast 'An account with this email already exists' and the registration form remained visible with entered values retained for correction, without navigating away. (Earlier FAIL verdict was a test artifact from an intervening full-page reload that had wiped the existing account; retested cleanly with in-app navigation only.)\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing into the search box (no submit button used) immediately updated both the result list and 'N items available' count for each query (PORTLAND->3, velvet->1, empty->10), confirming live updates as the buyer types or clears.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Each filter/sort change (category checkbox, condition checkbox, upcycled toggle, price slider, distance slider, sort dropdown) updated the displayed listings and the 'N items available' count immediately without any submit action. 'Clear all filters' immediately restored the unfiltered 10-item listing set.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking 'Add to Cart' immediately showed toast 'Added to cart!' and updated the header cart badge to '1' without reload. Navigating to /cart (in-app) showed the line item, quantity/count '1 item', and total '$285.00' all correctly reflecting the addition.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Verified product detail pages across multiple listings: prod-5 (Handmade Macrame Wall Hanging, marked Sold) correctly displays photo, title, description ($45), category (Home Decor), condition (New), location (Brooklyn, NY 3mi), seller (Emma Green, Brooklyn NY), listing date (Listed 2024-11-21), 'Upcycled' badge, and availability text 'This item is no longer available' matching its Sold status from My Listings. prod-2 (Vintage Denim Jacket, non-upcycled, Active) correctly shows photo, title, description, price $65, category Clothing, condition Good, location San Francisco CA 15mi, listed date 2024-11-18, seller Marcus Chen, no Upcycled badge (consistent with non-upcycled item), and enabled Add to Cart/Message Seller (consistent with Active/available status). All required fields present and consistent with underlying listing data across differing states.\"}]}"
      }
    ]
